+| `assert_compound_wear_missing_cell_is_null.sql` | Task 2A: `compound_cliff_wear_s` is NULL, not 0, when the lap has no compound parameter cell (NULL gradient and severity); every cell that exists, fitted or class_default, prices exactly as before. Self-contained on synthetic rows, so it bites without a cell-less lap in the warehouse | (macro only) | ✅ Active |
+| `assert_compound_cliff_predicted_missing_cell_unpriced.sql` | Task 2A: a valid lap with a known compound and tyre age but no `dim_compounds_season` cell has NULL `compound_wear_s` and `expected_compound_pace_s`; a lap with a cell (`is_measured` TRUE or FALSE) has numeric values | `int_compound_cliff_predicted`, `dim_compounds_season`, `race_to_track` | ✅ Active |
